SUMMARY:Beginner Lessons
DESCRIPTION:Get the confidence you’ve always wanted in the water and strengthen your skills with weekly 45-minute Adult Swim Lessons. Learn safety skills\, strokes and breathing techniques\, all for a low price. Choose a class time and register between Monday\, March 2 and Monday\, April 13 at the SRC Front Desk or on the SRC Portal. Hurry\, before spots fill! 
