SUMMARY:Sweatchella
DESCRIPTION:Get pumped for the ultimate musical fitness festival\, Sweatchella! Break a sweat with a live DJ in this high-energy\, festival-inspired workout experience. Explore a dynamic lineup of fusion workouts that blend different group exercise formats into one unforgettable fitness experience.  \n  \nAll Matadors are invited to the most vibrant gathering of the semester!   \n  \nRegister on the USU Rec & Wellness Portal or the MINDBODY app starting Monday\, April 20.   \n  \nDo you need interpretation for an event? If so\, please fill out the Interpreting Services Request Form at least seven business days prior to the event. 
URL:https://news.csun.edu/event/sweatchella/
