SUMMARY:Children’s Swim Lessons
DESCRIPTION:Parents\, set your children up for life by enrolling them in weekly 25-minute swim lessons! For just $50\, your child will be equipped with the important skills of knowing how to confidently breathe and move through the water. Meanwhile\, you’ll get peace of mind that they can play safely.   \n  \nRegister between Monday\, March 9 and Saturday\, April 18 at the SRC Front Desk before spots fill!   \n  \nFive spots available per class. Parents/guardians must have a valid Spring 2026 SRC membership and present a birth certificate for each child that is registered.  
URL:https://news.csun.edu/event/childrens-swim-lessons/2026-05-02/
LOCATION:Rec Pool\, Student Recreation Center\, University Student Union\, 18111 Nordhoff St.\, Northridge\, CA\, 91330-8449\, United States
CATEGORIES:Student Recreation Center,University Student Union
