SUMMARY:SRC Membership and Locker Service Renewals
DESCRIPTION:Spring 2026 memberships and locker service expire Friday\, May 15 at 8 p.m.   \nStarting Monday\, May 4\, you can renew your membership and locker services for the summer at the SRC front desk\, or by logging into the SRC portal. If you choose not to renew your locker service\, please remove all of your belongings before 8 p.m. on Friday\, May 15. Items that are left behind will be retained in accordance with the University Student Union lost and found policy.   \nIf you’re a CSUN student enrolled in Summer 2026\, your SRC membership fee is already included in your campus fees.   \nPlease visit the SRC front desk if you have any questions.   \n  \nNon-student members: The Oasis is open to you this summer!   \nWhen you purchase a summer SRC membership\, you can find relaxation all summer long. If you wish to only access the Oasis this summer\, please visit the Oasis front desk to purchase your membership.   \n Access to the Oasis will expire at the end of the summer on Friday\, August 14.   \n  \nRenew your membership and make plans to stay motivated at the SRC and Oasis! 
URL:https://news.csun.edu/event/src-membership-and-locker-service-renewals/
LOCATION:Student Recreation Center\, University Student Union\, 18111 Nordhoff St.\, Northridge\, CA\, 91330-8449\, United States
CATEGORIES:Student Recreation Center,University Student Union
