SUMMARY:Summer Night Hits
DESCRIPTION:Smash the competition in our summer softball season! Form a league of your own and battle it out for the championship title. Summer SRC members can register for free\, while non-members can join in on the fun for just $25. Catch some unforgettable memories in our scrimmage\, league and playoff games.   \nRegister on Fusion Play starting Tuesday\, May 12 before spots fill!  
