DESCRIPTION:Parents\, set your children up for life by enrolling them in weekly 25-minute swim lessons\, no SRC membership or CSUN affiliation required! Your child can participate in some summer fun\, while learning an important skill. They’ll be able to confidently breathe and move through the water\, while you’ll get peace of mindthat they can play safely.   \n  \nRegister between Monday\, April 13 and Saturday\, July 18 at the SRC Front Desk or online!   \n  \nFive spots available per class. Parents/guardians must present a signed waiver for each child prior to the first class.  
URL:https://news.csun.edu/event/childrens-swim-lessons-2/2026-06-06/
LOCATION:Rec Pool\, Student Recreation Center\, University Student Union\, 18111 Nordhoff St.\, Northridge\, CA\, 91330-8449\, United States
CATEGORIES:Student Recreation Center,University Student Union
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://news.csun.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/CAL-ChildrensSwim-SP26.png
ORGANIZER;CN="USU Student Recreation Center":MAILTO:src@csun.edu
GEO:34.240676354;-118.525553212
